{
  "$comment": "hongguo-next 设计令牌唯一真源（机器可读）。由 tools/gen_tokens.py 导出 CSS，由 tools/gen_tokens.py/check_tokens.py 校验 Flutter 侧 apps/android/lib/ui/tokens.dart。设计说明见 docs/DESIGN-SYSTEM.md §3。",
  "meta": {
    "name": "hongguo-next design tokens",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "spec": "docs/DESIGN-SYSTEM.md §3",
    "colorAuthority": "hex",
    "colorAuthorityReason": "Flutter 侧 Color(int) 无法表达 oklch，HEX 是两端都能无损表达的形式；oklch 为 CSS 表达，必须能往返到同一 hex（check_tokens.py 断言）。",
    "cssTarget": "apps/desktop/src/styles/tokens.css",
    "dartTarget": "apps/android/lib/ui/tokens.dart",
    "dartMode": "compare-only（本真源只校验 Dart，不覆盖它）",
    "wcag": {
      "textNormal": 4.5,
      "textLarge": 3.0,
      "nonText": 3.0,
      "note": "边框类令牌不声明门槛：§3.5 边框或投影二选一，边框为装饰性分隔；表单控件可辨识性由 --input + --ring 焦点环共同保证"
    }
  },
